      "message": "Integrate verified optimality proof and credit project contributors\n\nImport the proof sources and pinned Lean 4.34.1 configuration from EvolvingPrograms/11SquaresEvolving 1bf942a7, accepted in run 37414883750. All 7,920 modules passed; the final audit records zero admissions and explicitly retains native compiler trust for the approved numerical certificates.\n\nPreserve Formalized main history, the complete T03 tree, and public optimality statements. Include portable verification evidence, current reproduction instructions, a portable manual runner selection, and acknowledgements for EvolvingPrograms, ctjlewis, and the project/upstream contributors.\n\nValidation: all 7,920 source hashes match the successful run; accepted receipt/dependency/log audits and fresh source checks pass. Four workflow regression tests pass. No additional Lean compilation was performed during integration.",
